108:
109:This PAL also contains the decoding logic to drive the read latches clock lines 
110:(74ALS573 fall through latch). These clock lines have positive true outputs 
111:and are enabled when the CPU executes a MRDC, IORC, or INTA command.
112:The basic equation is: BxCK = BSOx * CMD * !LW_R
113:
114:*/
